<appendix id="installation">
<title>Installation</title>

<sect1 id="getting-tdesystemd">
<title>How to obtain &tdesystemd;</title>
<para>
The source code and Debian packages built for Debian 12
<quote>bookworm</quote> and Debian 13 <quote>trixie</quote> are available at
<ulink url="https://github.com/Yjlion/tde-systemd">https://github.com/Yjlion/tde-systemd</ulink>.
</para>
</sect1>

<sect1 id="compilation">
<title>Compilation and Installation</title>
<para>
You need the &tde; development packages (<filename>tdelibs14-trinity-dev</filename>,
<filename>tde-cmake</filename>) and CMake. Then run:
</para>
<screen><prompt>%</prompt> <userinput><command>cmake</command> -S . -B build -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/opt/trinity</userinput>
<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput><command>make</command> -C build</userinput>
<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput><command>sudo make</command> -C build install</userinput></screen>
<para>
The &polkit; policy is installed to
<filename>/usr/share/polkit-1/actions</filename>; change this with
<option>-DPOLKIT_ACTIONS_DIR=</option>.
</para>
</sect1>
</appendix>

&documentation.index;
</book>
